KUBERNATES - kubectl
  its a container orchistration tool using which all the underlying different types of containers can be managed
  
docker kubectl differ
  docker is a docker container orchistration tool which means the docker commands  only works when the underlying containers are all docker containers but kubctl can work 
  on any kind of containers and it can manage a huge no. of containers at a time 

KIND installation :

  curl -Lo ./kind https://kind.sigs.k8s.io/dl/latest/kind-linux-amd64
chmod +x ./kind
sudo mv ./kind /usr/local/bin/kind

 kubectl installation : kubectl manages cluster

  sudo apt install kubectl -y or sudo snap install kubectl --classic

cluster creation :

 kind create cluster 

verifying:
  kubectl get nodes
